  "description": "Internal E12 (E1..E21) sample slicer with slices at detected transients. The selected sample is analysed in the background (well under a second while the track is quiet); THRS sets how strong a transient must be (energy rise x1.25 at 0 to x4 at 127), SLIC the most slices, up to 32 (the strongest transients), SLNO the slice; until the analysis has the sample, SLIC equal slices. PTCH, DEC, TIME, PLAY as SMP-SL."
